[[File:Tamworth UK local election 2022 map.svg|thumb|Results by ward]]

The '''2022 Tamworth Borough Council election''' took place on 5 May 2022 to elect members of [[Tamworth Borough Council]] in England. This was on the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|local elections]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.tamworth.gov.uk/sites/default/files/councillors_docs/01-Notice-of-Election-Borough-LE-2022.pdf |title=Notice of Election |access-date=25 May 2022 |work=Tamworth Borough Council}}</ref>

